0..70 Comment "// A translation the default policy refuses before any process starts."
71..73 Comment "//"
74..150 Comment "// A translation is code at a site\'s boundary, so a manifold admits one only"
151..227 Comment "// by its `translation`. A manifold that states none is `Exact`, and `Exact`"
228..253 Comment "// admits no translation."
254..256 Comment "//"
257..334 Comment "// This file is a site and a manifold at once. `far` requires the older store"
335..413 Comment "// under `store` and under `cache`. The site answers `store` via the published"
414..484 Comment "// flow `downgrade`, and `cache` with a module of the older store. The"
485..558 Comment "// manifold states no translation, and the check refuses the placement at"
559..636 Comment "// `store` by name, before it judges the module. The file itself settles, and"
637..694 Comment "// `gandr check` of it as a deployment refuses the entry."
695..697 Comment "//"
698..775 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/translations/translated.gandr` — the program, whose"
776..811 Comment "//   `far` requires the older store"
812..892 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/translations/translated.manifold.gandr` — a flow under"
893..914 Comment "//   `Path`, admitted"
915..987 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-driver/tests/cli.rs` — the check refusing it"
989..1016 Comment "// The deployment theories."
